sessionalHymns.text:
Ever resplendent with divine dogmas, in thy sufferings thou didst offer thyself to the immortal King as a holy gift, O Dorotheus;
and now in gladness thou ever dwellest in the city on high.//
O venerable father, entreat Christ God, that He grant us great mercy.

ode4.irmos:
O Lord, I have heard the mystery of Thy dispensation;
I have considered Thy works,//
and I have glorified Thy Divinity.
